rem === BBjVector Creation and Iteration ===
rem Demonstrates: Creating a BBjVector, adding items, retrieving by index, iterating
rem Expected output:
rem   Size: 3
rem   alpha
rem   beta
rem   gamma
rem   Contains alpha: 1

rem Create and populate a BBjVector
vect! = BBjAPI().makeVector()
vect!.addItem("alpha")
vect!.addItem("beta")
vect!.addItem("gamma")
print "Size: ", vect!.size()

rem Iterate with for loop
for i = 0 to vect!.size() - 1
    print vect!.getItem(i)
next i

rem BBjVector also implements java.util.List
vect!.add("delta")
print "Contains alpha: ", vect!.contains("alpha")

release
